dium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/1c/fb/212012_crt_c51XX.jpg"},"summary":"幼い頃よりカイルの側に控える忠臣。\r\n騎馬の民フルリの血を引き、帝国随一の馬術家。従順で勤勉な性格と周りを和ませる雰囲気から、カイルや同僚からの信頼が厚い。","name":"キックリ","infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":212012,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/41/ef/209332_crt_3RISS.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/41/ef/209332_crt_3RISS.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/41/ef/209332_crt_3RISS.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/41/ef/209332_crt_3RISS.jpg"},"summary":"ヒッタイト帝国の第4皇子。\r\nカイルの異母兄弟で、最も信頼を寄せる腹心の弟。剣の腕と知略に長け、人の心を掴む性格からカイルとともにヒッタイト帝国の双璧と謳われる。ハットゥサの東にある商業都市カネシュの知事を務める。","name":"ザナンザ・ハットゥシリ","infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":209332,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":null,"birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/f5/a2/209334_crt_1vgaS.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/f5/a2/209334_crt_1vgaS.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/f5/a2/209334_crt_1vgaS.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/f5/a2/209334_crt_1vgaS.jpg"},"summary":"ナキア皇妃の側近の神官。\r\nマントで隠された顔立ちは優しげで美しく神々しいが、冷徹な策士。皇妃の息子の皇位継承を叶えるために尽くし、陰謀を画策する。","name":"ウルヒ","infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[]}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":209334,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/ea/67/204744_crt_q51R5.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/ea/67/204744_crt_q51R5.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/ea/67/204744_crt_q51R5.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/ea/67/204744_crt_q51R5.jpg"},"summary":"ヒッタイト帝国の第3皇子。\r\n才色兼備で人望にも厚く、皇位継承者最有力候補。戦の場においては、奇策を得意とする戦術家の顔を持つ。ユーリを成り行きで側室とするが、やがて真剣に愛するようになる。風を意のままに操ることができる高位の神官でもある。","name":"カイル・ムルシリ","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"凯尔·穆尔西里"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"ムルシリ2世"},{"v":"穆尔西里二世"},{"v":"Muršili II"},{"k":"第二中文名","v":"凯鲁·姆鲁西利"},{"k":"英文名","v":"Kail Mursili"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":1},"id":204744,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"male","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/a0/58/209335_crt_49RSX.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/a0/58/209335_crt_49RSX.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/a0/58/209335_crt_49RSX.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/a0/58/209335_crt_49RSX.jpg"},"summary":"戦車戦を得意とするミタンニ王国の最も恐るべき武将。\r\n冷酷無比な戦い方で「血の黒太子」と呼ばれる。女子供でさえ切り捨てる所業は、近隣諸国の人々を戦慄させる。","name":"マッティワザ","infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[{"v":"黒太子"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"男"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":209335,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/95/64/209331_crt_zea3b.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/95/64/209331_crt_zea3b.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/95/64/209331_crt_zea3b.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/95/64/209331_crt_zea3b.jpg"},"summary":"ヒッタイト帝国シュッピルリウマ帝の皇妃。\r\nタワナアンナの称号を持つ。バビロニア王国出身。神官としても高い能力があり、水を意のままに操る魔力を持つ。我が子の皇位継承に固執し、兄皇子達を呪い殺そうと企む。呪いの儀式の生贄として泉からユーリを召喚した。","name":"ナキア","infobox":[{"key":"别名","value":[]},{"key":"性别","value":"女"}],"stat":{"comments":0,"collects":0},"id":209331,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false},{"birth_mon":null,"gender":"female","birth_day":null,"birth_year":null,"blood_type":null,"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/e7/ca/204743_crt_XpIbe.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/e7/ca/204743_crt_XpIbe.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/e7/ca/204743_crt_XpIbe.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/e7/ca/204743_crt_XpIbe.jpg"},"summary":"日本で暮らす普通の女の子。\r\nある日、水中に引きずりこまれ、突如古代オリエント世界に召喚される。正義感が強く運動神経が良い。馬術や剣術にも優れ、やがて戦いの女神イシュタルとして名を馳せる。日本への帰還と、カイルへの想いとの間で揺れる。","name":"鈴木夕梨","infobox":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"铃木夕梨"},{"key":"别名","value":[{"k":"英文名","v":"Yuri Ishtar"},{"k":"日文名","v":"ユーリ"},{"k":"纯假名","v":"すずき ゆうり"},{"k":"罗马字","v":"Suzuki Yuuri"}]},{"key":"性别","value":"女"}],"stat":{"comments":3,"collects":2},"id":204743,"locked":false,"type":1,"nsfw":false}]}